      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `summarize_text.py` file that calls a hosted LLM to summarize long text, I will use the Amazon Bedrock service, which is a concrete external provider. I will import the necessary modules from the `boto3` library to interact with Amazon Bedrock and make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
